From: Omarchy Pi source-port candidate
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] vcsm: complete IMPORT before retiring DMA ownership

NONDEPLOYABLE: blocking completion has no peer-silence recovery guarantee.
No timeout, service close or host join is DMA quiescence proof.

